    - execution_flow_metadata      (Cached execution order)

    Enhanced Tables:
    - transformation_steps         (+ execution_group_id, visual_metadata)

    Features Added:
    ✅ Hybrid execution (parallel + inline in same pipeline)
    ✅ Dependency management between execution groups
    ✅ Visual pipeline configuration storage
    ✅ Execution flow caching for performance
    ✅ Circular dependency prevention
    ✅ Automatic V20 data migration

    Backward Compatibility:
    ✅ All V20 pipelines automatically migrated
    ✅ Existing execution_mode preserved
    ✅ No breaking changes to existing APIs

    Next Steps:
    1. Update Go models (models/execution_group_models.go)
    2. Create execution engine service
    3. Build frontend drag-drop UI
    ============================================================================
